1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,920
M: Hi, Suzie.

2
00:00:01,345 --> 00:00:03,325
I'm just ringing to see if you got the job.

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:04,605
W: Oh, hi John.

4
00:00:05,155 --> 00:00:06,585
Well, actually, I'm not sure.

5
00:00:07,145 --> 00:00:09,705
But I do have to go for a second interview this afternoon.

6
00:00:10,175 --> 00:00:10,705
M: That's great!

7
00:00:11,525 --> 00:00:12,725
I guess you must be excited.

8
00:00:13,645 --> 00:00:16,265
Where is your second meeting supposed to happen anyway?

9
00:00:16,815 --> 00:00:19,185
W: At the big building next to the art gallery downtown.

10
00:00:19,485 --> 00:00:24,395
Hey, do you think we can meet up for lunch today before I go to my interview?

11
00:00:25,045 --> 00:00:28,245
I really could use some inside information about your supervisor.

12
00:00:29,025 --> 00:00:30,345
He is going to interview me today.
